### 1. Get all books (default limit 10)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/

### 2. Search by title
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?search_q=the

### 3. Sort by price, highest first, 3 books
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?order_by=price&order=DESC&limit=3

### 4. Price range 300 to 400
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?min_price=300&max_price=400

### 5. Pagination: skip 2, take 2
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?limit=2&offset=2

### 6. Get one book
GET http://localhost:3000/books/4/

### 7. Add a book (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Python Basics",
  "author": "John",
  "price": 350,
  "pages": 250
}

### 8. Update a book (expect 200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/11/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Python Programming",
  "author": "John",
  "price": 450,
  "pages": 300
}

### 9. Delete a book (expect 200)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/11/

### 10. Book not found (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/999/

### 11. Invalid id (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/abc/

### 12. Invalid order_by (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?order_by=password

### 13. Invalid limit (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?limit=abc

### 14. min_price greater than max_price (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?min_price=500&max_price=100

### 15. POST missing title (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "John",
  "price": 350
}

### 16. POST non-numeric price (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bad Price",
  "author": "John",
  "price": "abc"
}

### 17. POST broken JSON (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{bad json

### 18. PUT book that does not exist (expect 404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/999/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A",
  "author": "B",
  "price": 1
}

### 19. DELETE book that does not exist (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/999/

### 20. Unknown route (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/nothing

### 21. SQL injection attempt (expect 200 with [], table survives)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?search_q=%27%3BDROP%20TABLE%20book%3B--